    // Rank 5 batch 32: Flame Strike at 6th — 10d6 fire: a creature with fire resistance 12 fails (resistance 6 applies), a creature immune to fire
    // at Reflex −10 rolls naturally (its result one degree better, the damage untyped), a plain creature fails (full).
