    // Rank 3 batch 24: Subjugate Undead (a level-1 undead fails: the caster's minion for 1 minute; a level-6 undead refused for a level-9 caster),
    // Sudden Recollection and Rewrite Memory (a failure gives the target the unlimited GM note).
