    // Rank 2 batch 79: Sweetest Solstice from its confirmed outcome: four secondary casters are refused (at most 3); a success gives the caster and
    // two secondary casters PF2e's Effect (fear only, 30 days); a critical success adds emotion; a critical failure locks Sickened 4 for 12 hours
    // (a reduction is refused), after which it recovers normally.
