    // Cantrip / rank 1 batch 86: Signal Skyrocket — the GM's yes/no on "If the rocket explodes in an enclosed space …": yes applies
    // the rows (half / full and Dazzled / double and Blinded); no leaves every creature unaffected. The placement rule is a note.
