    // Cantrip / rank 1 batch 141 (user decision): Manifest Will — PF2e's Aura on the caster; each creature beginning its turn in the 10-foot
    // emanation gets PF2e's Spell Effect with the caster's tradition. Primal: −10 Speed, ended by an Escape; none outside. Occult: allies only.
